DESCRIPTION:Chin Music has two meanings: one is idle talk\, the other is a 
 brushback throw in baseball or cricket to intimidate the batter. Both descr
 ibe Rich Hall's comedy. Idle but intimidating. Sharp\, quick\, splenetic an
 d sublimely improvisational. If you've never seen him\, you need to hustle 
 down and grab a seat because he never disappoints. Ever. 'Blissfully funny'
  (Guardian).\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/rich-ha
 ll-chin-music/
